--- a/src/premap2/domains.py
+++ b/src/premap2/domains.py
@@ DomainList.save
             domain_list.append((
                 d.preimg_A.detach(),
                 d.preimg_b.detach().ravel(),
                 d.preimg_vol,
                 d.approx_vol,
                 d.history,
+                None if d.poly_A is None else d.poly_A.detach(),
+                None if d.poly_b is None else d.poly_b.detach().ravel(),
+                None if d.lower_in is None else d.lower_in.detach(),
+                None if d.upper_in is None else d.upper_in.detach(),
             ))

This is an experiment-local serialization-only addition. `poly_A`, `poly_b`,
and input bounds are already computed before `DomainList.save`; retaining them
allows the saved native ReLU-split domain to be decoded as the intersection of
its output-margin and branch-region inequalities.  It does not change bound
computation, refinement, scheduling, or output values.

